WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.800 --> 00:00:11.070
The names of all the continents end with the
same letter they begin with.

00:00:11.070 --> 00:00:13.700
Mars has blue sunsets.

00:00:13.700 --> 00:00:18.929
The fine dust in the atmosphere is just the
right size for blue light to penetrate more

00:00:18.929 --> 00:00:22.669
efficiently than other colours in the spectrum.

00:00:22.669 --> 00:00:28.550
The Golden Temple in the western Indian city
of Amristar runs a free kitchen operated by

00:00:28.550 --> 00:00:33.580
volunteers that serves over 100,00 hot meals
a day.

00:00:33.580 --> 00:00:37.420
It has been going for over 300 years.

00:00:37.420 --> 00:00:43.090
When the world's largest diamond, the Cullinan
Diamond was transported from Africa to England,

00:00:43.090 --> 00:00:49.649
an elaborate and secure journey by sea was
heavily publicised, but it was just a gigantic

00:00:49.649 --> 00:00:50.739
distraction.

00:00:50.739 --> 00:00:53.750
The diamond was simply posted by mail.

00:00:53.750 --> 00:00:59.700
In 1946 a man claiming to be a detective gave
a pedestrian a camera and asked her to take

00:00:59.700 --> 00:01:01.879
a picture of a suspect.

00:01:01.879 --> 00:01:07.930
The "detective" turned out to be a gangster,
the "suspect" was actually his ex-wife, and

00:01:07.930 --> 00:01:14.130
the "camera" was actually a concealed shotgun
that was fired by the camera shutter button.

00:01:14.130 --> 00:01:20.770
In Japan, 'yaeba' or crooked teeth in girls
is considered cute and attractive.

00:01:20.770 --> 00:01:24.890
Girls actually undergo procedures to un0straighten
their teeth.

00:01:24.890 --> 00:01:28.750
Women end up digesting most of the lipstick
they apply.

00:01:28.750 --> 00:01:33.950
In fact the average woman consumes about 3
kilograms of lipstick in her lifetime.

00:01:33.950 --> 00:01:39.160
The average office desk has 400 times more
bacteria than a toilet.

00:01:39.160 --> 00:01:44.790
The first time someone attempted to publish
the secrets of the Freemasons in 1826 he was

00:01:44.790 --> 00:01:46.680
kidnapped and murdered.

00:01:46.680 --> 00:01:51.750
A study at Oxford University found that for
every person you fall in love with, you lose

00:01:51.750 --> 00:01:53.610
two close friends.

00:01:53.610 --> 00:01:57.430
Hamsters only blink with one eye at a time.

00:01:57.430 --> 00:02:03.180
In 2002, Steven Spielberg finally finished
college after a 33 years hiatus.

00:02:03.180 --> 00:02:06.780
He turned in Schindler's List for his student
film requirement.

00:02:06.780 --> 00:02:11.220
An olive tree can live up to 1,500 years.

00:02:11.220 --> 00:02:15.980
A lump of pure gold the size of a matchbox
can be flattened into a sheet the size of

00:02:15.980 --> 00:02:17.590
a tennis court.

00:02:17.590 --> 00:02:21.390
Dormitory is an anagram for "Dirty Room".

00:02:21.390 --> 00:02:24.030
Almonds are members of the peach family.

00:02:24.030 --> 00:02:29.440
Accompanied by the cherry and plum.

